 "remarks": "A wonderful opportunity awaits you as you move into your beautiful spacious 2 bedroom 1 bath in this desirable Glenbrook neighborhood. The thoughtfully designed open concept one floor living and dining room with plenty of natural light. Enjoy your private deck with generous room sizes and a comfortable flow of everyday living and entertaining makes this unit more desirable. A full eat in kitchen with lots of cabinet space and dining table completes your experience. Complete your home with two spaciously sized bedrooms to enjoy. This unit comes with an additional storage unit for extra space and assigned parking space #26. Conveniently located near Chelsea Pier, couple minutes to Interstate 95 and short drive to Stamford Train Station and Downtown Stamford. Come take a look.",
